{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_evals_eval_engine_plan_corrected_plan", "label": "Eval engine \u2014 research findings and corrected plan", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/evals/eval-engine-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Two earlier drafts specced building things that already existed; this version is written after empirical verification \u2014 every claim checked by running the code or recomputing the numbers, not by reading prose."}, {"id": "docs_evals_eval_engine_plan_headline_metric_bug", "label": "Headline metric bug (engagement conflated with quality)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/evals/eval-engine-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Worth more than any new infrastructure: sonnet's 40% is entirely engagement failure (2/5 engaged, 6/6 on attempted criteria), so 'sonnet is worse at the work' is unsupported while 'sonnet fails to drive the skill' is \u2014 a skill/prompt defect with a completely different fix."}, {"id": "docs_evals_eval_engine_plan_engagement_measured_not_assumed", "label": "Engagement measured, not assumed (fix 2026-07-27)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/evals/eval-engine-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "loadCells() hardcoded engaged:true because a .grade file only existed for cells that engaged. Now every cell gets a record and engagement is tri-state (true/false/null): a record with no engaged field stays unknown and keeps the \u2020 marker rather than being promoted to a measurement."}, {"id": "docs_evals_eval_engine_plan_power_analysis", "label": "Power analysis of the frozen suite", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/evals/eval-engine-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Today's n=7 is underpowered even for the 100%->60% gap (needs ~14); 10pp effects are out of reach at ~293 runs/arm, so declare an MDE of ~20pp and design around it."}, {"id": "docs_evals_eval_engine_plan_criterion_clustering", "label": "Criteria within a task are not independent", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/evals/eval-engine-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The 3-8 criteria inside one task share a single conductor run, so treating 114 clustered observations as 114 Bernoullis overstates power. The honest fix is each task's f2p pass fraction as a continuous per-task score compared with a paired test."}, {"id": "docs_evals_eval_engine_plan_swe_compare", "label": "swe-compare.mjs with an 'I can't tell' verdict", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/evals/eval-engine-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Exit 0 no difference / 1 difference detected / 2 underpowered or non-comparable \u2014 the third code exists so an underpowered comparison cannot masquerade as a null result. Refuses outright when suite fingerprints differ."}, {"id": "docs_evals_eval_engine_plan_train_val_split", "label": "Train/val split over the task suite", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/evals/eval-engine-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Without it any optimiser reading these tasks overfits them; optimisers read train, the gate scores val."}, {"id": "docs_evals_eval_engine_plan_orphan_tasks", "label": "Orphan tasks idle outside the suite", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/evals/eval-engine-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "notes-selective-sync (5 criteria) and notes-wide-features (8) exist on disk but are not in the suite \u2014 13 validated criteria sitting idle."}, {"id": "docs_evals_eval_engine_plan_suite_hash_churn", "label": "Suite-hash churn makes history non-comparable", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/evals/eval-engine-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three eras across seven scorecards; only two match the current fingerprint, so 5 of 7 rows are already stale."}, {"id": "docs_evals_eval_engine_plan_l2_gate_premature", "label": "A blocking eval gate is premature at n=7-27", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/evals/eval-engine-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The comparator cannot support blocking anything under ~20pp, so it should report loudly until the suite is big enough to block."}, {"id": "docs_evals_eval_engine_plan_capability_floor_open_decision", "label": "Open decision: conductor's contractual capability floor", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/evals/eval-engine-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The engagement finding suggests today's real answer is 'opus engages reliably, sonnet does not' \u2014 a fixable skill bug, not a model verdict. Engagement failures should probably also be auto-filed as backlog items rather than silently depressing a model's score."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_evals_eval_engine_plan_corrected_plan", "target": "docs_arena_scores_readme_conductor_scoreboard", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/evals/eval-engine-plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_evals_eval_engine_plan_corrected_plan", "target": "docs_evals_eval_engine_plan_headline_metric_bug", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/evals/eval-engine-plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_evals_eval_engine_plan_headline_metric_bug", "target": "docs_arena_scores_readme_engagement_column", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/evals/eval-engine-plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_evals_eval_engine_plan_engagement_measured_not_assumed", "target": "docs_arena_scores_readme_dagger_engagement_assumed", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/evals/eval-engine-plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_evals_eval_engine_plan_engagement_measured_not_assumed", "target": "docs_arena_scores_readme_swe_run", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/evals/eval-engine-plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_evals_eval_engine_plan_power_analysis", "target": "docs_arena_scores_readme_minimum_detectable_effect", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/evals/eval-engine-plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_evals_eval_engine_plan_criterion_clustering", "target": "docs_evals_eval_engine_plan_power_analysis", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/evals/eval-engine-plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_evals_eval_engine_plan_swe_compare", "target": "docs_arena_scores_readme_suite_hash_comparability", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/evals/eval-engine-plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_evals_eval_engine_plan_swe_compare", "target": "docs_evals_eval_engine_plan_criter